'''Monkey King''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 90
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Monkey King
|name2 = SSS Monkey King
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''SSS Monkey King''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Monkey King is comparable in power to [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]], but has lower attack and defense stats in comparison, along with no [[Talents]]. Thus, he will only serve to be a spammable attacker, but this niche role is taken by [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] meaning that there's less of a reason to use the Monkey King, unless you have no better units for more DPS and support.

{{Job|Classification = Melee}}

